{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12111130","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12111130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1211113001:0":{"text":"저기, 내가 곰곰이 생각해 봤는데, 역시 모두에게 말하는 게 좋을 것 같아.","source_cn":"各位，我仔细想了想，还是决定告诉你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58B6B3CA2942A32C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211113002:0":{"text":"왜 그래? 갑자기 진지하게.","source_cn":"怎么了？突然这么严肃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x171815BECF39488A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211113003:0":{"text":"조금 전에 나도 봤어.","source_cn":"刚才，我也看到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x867969B3B51BA080","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1211113003":{"text":"조금 전에 나도 봤어.","source_cn":"刚才，我也看到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x867969B3B51BA080","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211113004:0":{"text":"역시 당신 눈은 속일 수가 없네.","source_cn":"果然没逃过你的眼睛。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x48ACBC0DC572F367","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"역시 당신 눈은 속일 수가 없네.","female":"역시 당신 눈은 속일 수가 없네.","variant_male_record_index":"131599","variant_female_record_index":"131600","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211113005:0":{"text":"맞아. <style=\"highlight\">유령이 된 나라</style>를 보았어.","source_cn":"是的，我看见了<style=highlight>幽灵形...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCE34261B1DF05902","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"맞아. <style=\"highlight\">유령이 된 나라</style>를 보았어.","female":"맞아. <style=\"highlight\">유령이 된 나라</style>를 보았어.","variant_male_record_index":"131601","variant_female_record_index":"131602","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211113008:0":{"text":"다른 사람들의 반응을 보니, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 우리만 본 것 같아.","source_cn":"我观察了一下其他人的反应，<style=stress>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6A8AC38B1A594409","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"다른 사람들의 반응을 보니, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 우리만 본 것 같아.","female":"다른 사람들의 반응을 보니, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 우리만 본 것 같아.","variant_male_record_index":"131607","variant_female_record_index":"131608","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1211113009:0":{"text":"하지만 나라는 바로 네 옆에 있잖아? 분명 환각이었을 거야.","source_cn":"但是奈拉不就在你身边吗？肯定是幻觉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89A5CDEABE695B4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211113010:0":{"text":"오는 길에 다들 환각 증상이 나타났어... 설마 어젯밤 먹은 음식에 환각을 유발하는 물질이 있었던 걸까?","source_cn":"这一路走来，大家都出现了各种各样的幻觉……难道是昨晚吃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x491603835BEF3E76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211113011:0":{"text":"그럼 더 일찍 환각이 나타났어야 해.","source_cn":"那早该出现幻觉了才对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66289EA7D6939F6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1211113012:0":{"text":"유령인 “나”는 어땠어?\n반투명이었어? 얼굴이 창백했어? 뭘 하고 있었어? 언니한테 인사했어?","source_cn":"幽灵的“我”是什么样？\\n半透明的吗？脸惨白吗？我在做...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CC94DB884C3C872","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211113013:0":{"text":"\"넌\" 날 보자마자 도망쳤어.","source_cn":"“你”看到我就跑了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0AC42DF1F50BA9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1211113014:0":{"text":"내 생각엔 그 장난치는 걸 좋아하는 요정이 우리를 위해 또 다른 시련을 준비한 게 아닐까 싶어.","source_cn":"我在想，这说不定是那个喜欢捉弄人的妖精，为我们临时加码...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B8C080BB4252F12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1211113015:0":{"text":"나랑 신밧드가 본 유령은 전부 “가족”이잖아. 우리의 의지를 시험하고 있는 게 아닐까?","source_cn":"因为我和辛巴达看到的，全都是“亲人”的幽灵。她是不是在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DA966370AB7BFED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1211113016:0"